    "overview": "Upgrade your laundry experience with the all-new Intex SA90BGHG Semi-Automatic Washing Machine , designed for powerful performance and effortless cleaning. Built with a bigger drum and advanced pulsator technology , it ensures deep cleaning while saving your time and effort. Equipped with a powerful motor and 3 wash programs , this washing machine delivers efficient and customized washing for different fabric types. The Aqua Brush and Scrubber Technology work together to remove tough stains, while the Magic Filter captures lint for cleaner clothes. Designed for durability and convenience, it features a rust-free body, toughened glass lids, and hydraulic lid mechanism for smooth operation. The noise-free spinning system and vibration control pads ensure a stable and quiet performance. With added features like easy mobility wheels, end cycle buzzer, and single water inlet , this washing machine is perfect for modern Indian households looking for performance, durability, and value for money . Bigger Drum. Smaller Effort. Powerful Cleaning.",
